{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33372","headline":"赋得秋菊有佳色 · 公乘亿","name":"赋得秋菊有佳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶令篱边菊，秋来色转佳。\n翠攒千片叶，金剪一枝花。\n蘂逐蜂须乱，英随蝶翅斜。\n带香飘绿绮，和酒上乌纱。\n散漫摇霜彩，娇妍漏日华。\n芳菲彭泽见，更称在谁家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"公乘亿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}